Lone Echo OpenXR compatibility runtime

Derived from TesseractCat/libovr-openxr-rs:
https://github.com/TesseractCat/libovr-openxr-rs
Revision 49c48292510b771e68ba8a85b45c7b2c35c0654b
Upstream declares MIT OR Apache-2.0 in Cargo.toml. This distribution uses the
Apache-2.0 option. The upstream checkout did not include a NOTICE file.

Local modifications add D3D11/legacy CAPI frame support, correct the public
HMD ABI and controller masks, use OpenXR aim poses and native velocities,
and supply local platform initialization responses and missing exports.

Third-party dependencies retain their respective licenses. Their notices
are provided in the release's licenses directory.
